<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair, Delta, AUA, Sabena to expand cooperation.</title>
<headline>Swissair, Delta, AUA, Sabena to expand cooperation.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair AG, Delta Air Lines Austrian Airlines and Sabena will introduce joint operations across the North Atlantic from February 1, 1997, Swissair said.</p>
</text>
